@startuml
actor Student
participant Browser
participant Handler
participant Board
database SQLite
Student -> Browser: Submit question
Browser -> Handler: POST /api/questions
Handler -> Board: submit(validated fields)
Board -> SQLite: BEGIN IMMEDIATE + lookup retry
alt Existing identical request
SQLite --> Board: existing ID
else New request
Board -> SQLite: insert question + audit / COMMIT
SQLite --> Board: new ID
end
Board --> Handler: ID and replay status
Handler --> Browser: 201 JSON
Browser -> Handler: GET public queue
Handler --> Browser: question without author
@enduml
